<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>{title} · HiFage</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><meta property="og:title" content={`${title} · HiFage`}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><link rel="stylesheet" href={`${base}skills.css`}/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href={`${base}apple-touch-icon.png`}/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2064%2064%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%2264%22%20height%3D%2264%22%20rx%3D%2215%22%20fill%3D%22%23e65021%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M17%2025Q16%2018%2024%2017H42Q48%2020%2047%2029L45%2043Q40%2051%2032%2053Q23%2050%2019%2043Z%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff0d5%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M13%2028L16%2017L13%2014Q24%2016%2031%207L31%2013Q42%208%2049%2012L45%2016L52%2017L48%2028L41%2023Q27%2028%2018%2024L17%2030Z%22%20fill%3D%22%2323251d%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M15%2029H29L32%2031L35%2029H49L47%2040H36L33%2034H31L28%2040H17Z%22%20fill%3D%22%2323251d%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M26%2046Q32%2049%2038%2044%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%2323251d%22%20stroke-width%3D%222.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E"></head><body><main><a href={`${base}#desk`}>← 回到发哥的桌面</a><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT / ANDROID</p><h1>{title}</h1><p>把 Android 通知管理得更清楚。</p><p class="project-license">源码公开 · 非商业许可</p><section><h2>这是做什么的？</h2><p>通知了（MagicNotice）是一个 Android 通知管理应用。这里集中放好项目的源码和发布入口，方便你阅读、体验和继续了解。</p><div class="project-actions"><a href="https://github.com/fage-go/magicnotice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看公开源码 ↗</a></div><p>下方提供最新已发布的中英文签名 APK，可能包含预发布版本。</p></section><ProjectRelease project={projects.magicnotice}/><section><h2>使用前，先看许可</h2><p>项目采用非商业源码许可。源码公开不等于可以自由商用，具体使用范围以仓库中的 LICENSE 和第三方声明为准。</p><p><a href="https://github.com/fage-go/magicnotice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往仓库查看许可与说明 ↗</a></p></section></main></body></html>
<style>.project-license{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #cbb48e;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;color:#795737}.project-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0}.project-actions a{padding:10px 15px;background:#f1dfc1;border:1px solid #c4a67c;border-radius:5px;text-decoration:none}.project-actions a:hover{background:#e9d0a8}</style>
